SUMMARY:Music in the Park at Grindstone
DESCRIPTION:Every 4th Friday of the month May through October\, we host Music in the Park\, our summer series with music\, food trucks and wine. \nBest of all\, this event is family-friendly\, so bring the whole gang along and enjoy an evening at Grindstone under our market lights. Pack those lawn chairs\, mark your calendars\, and join us for a night of wine & local live music! \n Select wines by the glass and our full bottle selection. \nOur FIRST Music in the Park of the year! \n\n\nMay 22nd from 6-9 pm \n\n\nJune 26th from 6-9 pm \n\n\nJuly 24th from 6-9 pm \n\n\nAugust 28th from 6-9 pm \n\n\nSeptember 25th from 6-9 pm \n\n\nOctober 23rd from 6-9 pm \n\n\nSee the full concert & food truck schedule here!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/music-in-the-park-at-grindstone-2/2026-09-25/
LOCATION:Grindstone Wines\, 12700 County Road 89\, Esparto\, CA\, 95627\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Musicinthepark.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Grindstone Wines":MAILTO:molly@grindstonewines.com
END:VEVENT
