SUMMARY:Yoga at the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard in Davis  Saturday\, September 26 | 9:00–10:00 AMTicket Includes: Yoga ClassStart your weekend with fresh air\, gentle movement\, and beautiful vineyard views!Join us for a relaxing outdoor yoga class designed for all experience levels\, especially those new to yoga. Our professional instructors will guide you through the fundamentals with gentle stretches\, basic poses\, and mindful movement in a welcoming\, supportive setting.Surrounded by our organic vineyard\, wildflowers\, and peaceful morning scenery\, it’s the perfect way to stretch\, breathe\, and ease into your weekend.What to Bring:• Yoga mat• Towel• WaterCome stretch\, breathe\, and start your weekend the Great Bear way!
