SUMMARY:Pilates in the Pollinator Garden
DESCRIPTION:Build strength\, improve flexibility\, and reconnect with your body in this pilates mat class in the pollinator garden. This energizing\, full-body workout combines mindful movement\, core-focused exercises\, and controlled breathing to leave you feeling stronger\, balanced\, and refreshed. All ages and abilities welcome! \nAfter class\, each participant receives a refreshing glass of Honey Hibiscus Cooler or a sparkling mead beverage. \nBring your yoga mat\, water and wear comfortable clothes. If the weather is too cool or too hot\, we’ll practice indoors\, among the honey drums. \n 
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/pilates-in-the-pollinator-garden-2/
