SUMMARY:Festival de la Comunidad (Carnitas Festival)
DESCRIPTION:September 26\, 4-10PM\, Free fun community event with carnitas plates\, food trucks \, live entertainment at Rotary Park in Winters! \n\nThe Festival de la Comunidad is a free community event that features live music\, food trucks\, folkloric dance\, mariachi music\, Banda\, and a very large Children’s Area. We sell beverages and a limited number of Carnitas Plates to help fund the event.
